    <string name="sniffer_content_title">Captured content</string>
    <string name="sniffer_content_body">• Initial header: ro.product.model, fingerprint\n• Live: full logcat threadtime + events buffer (no filter, nothing missed)\n• Auto snap every 60 s (overwrites _snap.txt): dumpsys display, SurfaceFlinger, window, activity, meminfo, ps -A\n• Manual snapshot: marks the timestamp in the main log + refreshes the snap\n• Persistence: capture survives Activity rotation/destruction (setsid process)</string>
    <string name="sniffer_procedure_title">Typical procedure</string>
    <string name="sniffer_procedure_body">1. Press Start\n2. Reproduce the bug on screen\n3. Press Snapshot to mark the exact moment\n4. Press Stop\n5. Press Export to share the file (log + snap)\n6. Cleanup: deletes previous captures (current session is preserved)</string>

